    "name": {
      "value": "Raised by Belief"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Whether in a monastery, a religious household, or just as part of your everyday life, your upbringing was steeped in the traditions of a particular deity. You might remain committed or you may have turned from your childhood creed, but your skills are still founded in your devotion. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to an attribute specified in your deity's Divine Attribute and the other is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the deity's listed Divine Skill and gain the Assurance feat with that skill. You are also trained in a Lore skill related to your deity (Abadar Lore, for example)."
    },
